cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AuditKit
abstract: |
  AuditKit is a Python library for evaluating and auditing AI models: a unified
  evaluation spine across techniques and modalities. It provides 10 metric
  families, 9 model backends, LLM-as-judge and encoder-judge scorers, a CLI with
  YAML-configured runs, and an MkDocs documentation site.
type: software
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."

